                    That blessed mood, In which the burthen of the mystery, In which the heavy and the weary weight Of all this unintelligible world, Is lightened:—that serene and blessed mood, In which the affections gently lead us on, Until, the breath of this corporeal frame And&hellip;
                ]]>
